{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團ENHYPEN成員梁禎元與JAY（朴綜星）近日在社交平台發布一段「加料飲品」整蠱短片，因涉及在飲品中「落藥」及暈倒的劇情，被網民炮轟將「迷姦」等犯罪行為當玩笑，有美化犯罪之嫌，在社交網引起爭議後，影片已遭下架。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.756805+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:57:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.562320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.562320+00:00","content_hash":"c933c511a37f42d0d3b89ce3e80aa82ab90d49df597065efc44f113a804c5557","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}